# Rhapsodies of Vana'diel (RoV 1-1): the level's other side. A level 2 Warrior of Bastok with it current (a fresh
# char) logs in in Bastok Markets, an entry zone: main level 2 fails the check: no 30035 (the login plays whatever
# else the zone has: SoA 1-1's 22).
lists BastokMarkets/onZoneIn/1
char zone=BastokMarkets pos=-6,0,-50 job=WAR lvl=2 nation=1
login                                       # level 2: no section: no 30035
